Memory Cleanerer\par
\par
Memory Cleanerer is free software, forever. No license fee, no subscription, no catch.\par
\par
It makes no network connections, sends no telemetry, and collects nothing. The only things it touches are your RAM, its own settings file, and the Windows APIs it documents on its About page.\par
\par
Memory cleaning provides limited, mostly temporary benefit on modern Windows \emdash  Windows already manages RAM well on its own. Memory Cleanerer does exactly what each button says, no more, and charges nothing for any of it.\par
\par
By continuing, you acknowledge the above.\par
